  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "당신...\n궁극의 기술에 관심 있으신가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0002E002E002E000AAD81ADF9C7580020AE30C220C5D00020AD00C2EC0020C788C73CC2E0AC00C694003F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐 하는 분이세요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB500020D558B2940020BD84C774C138C694003F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "말씀해 보세요<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9D0C500D5740020BCF4C138C69400100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당당함이 느껴지는 자태...\n좋습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9B2F9D568C7740020B290AEF4C9C0B2940020C790D0DC002E002E002E000AC88BC2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리자몽, 번치코,\n염무왕, 마폭시...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n거북왕, 대짱이,\n장크로다일, 개굴닌자...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이상해꽃, 나무킹,\n메가니움, 브리가론...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 포켓몬들만이 배울 수 있는\n궁극의 기술을 사용할 수 있게 해 드리죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4B9CCC7740020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788B294000AAD81ADF9C7580020AE30C220C7440020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020D5740020B4DCB9ACC8E0002100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단, 특정 포켓몬 1마리만을 사용해서\n3마리의 포켓몬을 쓰러뜨리는<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8002C0020D2B9C8150020D3ECCF13BAAC00200031B9C8B9ACB9CCC7440020C0ACC6A9D574C11C000A0033B9C8B9ACC7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C4F0B7ECB728B9ACB29400100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "험난한 시련을 돌파하실 수 있다면 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5D8B09CD55C0020C2DCB828C7440020B3CCD30CD558C2E40020C2180020C788B2E4BA740020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시련에 도전할 각오가 되시거든\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCB828C5D00020B3C4C804D5600020AC01C624AC000020B418C2DCAC70B4E0000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "궁극의 기술에\n관심이 있으신 모양이군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD81ADF9C7580020AE30C220C5D0000AAD00C2ECC7740020C788C73CC2E00020BAA8C591C774AD70C694002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 설명해 드리죠.\n시련은 총 3개가 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C124BA85D5740020B4DCB9ACC8E0002E000AC2DCB828C7400020CD1D00200033AC1CAC000020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3개의 시련 모두 포켓몬을 1마리만 데리고\n저와 승부해서 이기시면 클리어입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0033AC1CC7580020C2DCB8280020BAA8B4500020D3ECCF13BAACC74400200031B9C8B9ACB9CC0020B370B9ACACE0000AC800C6400020C2B9BD80D574C11C0020C774AE30C2DCBA740020D074B9ACC5B4C785B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먼저 풀의 시련! 메가니움 1마리로\n불꽃타입 포켓몬 3마리를 이겨야 합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA3CC8000020D480C7580020C2DCB82800210020BA54AC00B2C8C6C000200031B9C8B9ACB85C000ABD88AF43D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC00200033B9C8B9ACB97C0020C774ACA8C57C0020D569B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음은 불꽃의 시련! 염무왕 1마리로\n물타입 포켓몬 3마리를 이겨야 하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC7400020BD88AF43C7580020C2DCB82800210020C5FCBB34C65500200031B9C8B9ACB85C000ABB3CD0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC00200033B9C8B9ACB97C0020C774ACA8C57C0020D558C8E0002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마지막으로 물의 시련! 장크로다일 1마리로\n풀타입 포켓몬 3마리를 이기시면 됩니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C9C0B9C9C73CB85C0020BB3CC7580020C2DCB82800210020C7A5D06CB85CB2E4C77C00200031B9C8B9ACB85C000AD480D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC00200033B9C8B9ACB97C0020C774AE30C2DCBA740020B429B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "각 시련을 클리어할 때마다\n궁극의 기술을 하나씩 전수해 드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC010020C2DCB828C7440020D074B9ACC5B4D5600020B54CB9C8B2E4000AAD81ADF9C7580020AE30C220C7440020D558B098C5290020C804C218D5740020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되는 대로\n시련을 시작하도록 하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B418B2940020B300B85C000AC2DCB828C7440020C2DCC791D558B3C4B85D0020D558C8E0002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 시련에 도전하실 거죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
